# Force LF regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf: gofmt (and Go tooling generally) always
# normalizes to LF, so a CRLF checkout makes `gofmt -l` flag nearly every file with no real
# formatting drift. text=auto still lets git's own content sniffing skip genuine binaries; the
# lines below are a belt-and-braces guarantee for the binary files already tracked here plus any
# added later.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
